  "id": "hz",
  "term": "Hz",
  "definition": "In this context, Hz is the frequency label used in the term 40-Hz auditory steady-state response. That 40-Hz response is used to examine gamma-range neural synchrony and is considered an indicator of excitation–inhibition balance in cortical microcircuits.",
